## Closeout incident (honest disclosure)

CONCIERGE closeout caught that the live store still showed ◐ units: my 18:21–18:22 UTC writes had
landed in `/tmp/ft-cord-verify.zIaX` — `FLEET_TASKS_HOME` was still exported in my shell (second
occurrence of this exact self-inflicted bug this mission). Board D4 rows were correct (D4 posts
regardless of home); the live store was not. Fixed: unset, replayed the two missing transitions
(u-rolefix t1, u-dogfood t3) against the live store, re-verified render ✓4.

## Lessons codified (also on board)

1. Escape-hatch flags mask dead primary paths — dogfood early.
2. herdr pane `done` is an attention flag, not a completion contract — done-notifications should
   key on `.done` markers, not pane status.
3. D4 side effect fires regardless of FLEET_TASKS_HOME — test-scoped writes post real board rows.
4. CORD shells accumulate env — `env | grep FLEET_TASKS` before any live-store write.

